MID_LGV_2BEL_c01_Gat_m01_001: 
MID_LGA_2BEL_c01_Gat_m01: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_B01_m01_001: 现在动身的话，\n应该还来得及跟主力军会合！
